#!/usr/bin/env lux

[doc]
    Hej
[enddoc]

#[global fail_pattern=[Ee][Rr][Rr][Oo][Rr]]
#[config require=MAKE]
#[global OPER_PROMPT=admin@.*>]

[shell update]
    [timeout 10]
    !rm /tmp/nso-ha-control.log
    ?SH-PROMPT

[shell update]
    !./nso-ha-control --scripting package-update --package ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 --debug
    """???
Getting HA status and configuration from nodes n1, n2, n3 OK

+------+------------+--------------+-----------------+-----------------+
| node | ip         | current_role | default-ha-role | failover-master |
+------+------------+--------------+-----------------+-----------------+
| n1   | 172.18.1.2 | master       | master          |                 |
| n2   | 172.18.2.2 | slave        | slave           | yes             |
| n3   | 172.18.2.3 | slave        | slave           |                 |
+------+------------+--------------+-----------------+-----------------+
default-ha-role and failover-master was retrieved from node "n1"
    """
    """???
    n1:
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| loaded          | installed                 | installable               |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+

n2:
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| loaded          | installed                 | installable               |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+

n3:
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| loaded          | installed                 | installable               |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
    """
    ???Are you sure you want to continue? (y/N):
    !y
    ?Making master node readonly OK
    ?Backing up CDB on slaves...
    [timeout 300]
    ?Backing up node n1: running
    ?Backing up node n2: running
    ?Backing up node n3: running
    ?Backing up node n1: OK
    ?Backing up node n2: OK
    ?Backing up node n3: OK
    [timeout 30]
    ?Deactivating slaves...
    ?Deactivating HA on nodes n2, n3 OK
    ?Deinstalling package on slaves OK
    ?Installing package on slaves OK
    ?Reload packages on slaves...
    [timeout 300]
    ?Reloading packages on slave n2: running
    ?Reloading packages on slave n3: running
    ?Reloading packages on slave n2: OK
    ?Reloading packages on slave n3: OK
    [timeout 30]
    ?Deactivating master...
    ?Deactivating HA on nodes n1 OK
    ?Activating failover-master as active master...
    ?Overrideing HA role on node n2 OK
    ?Activating HA on node n2 OK
    ?Making master node readwrite... OK
    ?Deinstalling package on master... OK
    ?Installing package on master... OK
    [timeout 300]
    ?Reloading packages on master n1: running
    ?Reloading packages on master n1: OK
    [timeout 30]
    ?Reverting role HA on slave n1 OK
    ?Forcing be slave HA role on slave n1 --> n2 OK
    ?Activating HA on slave n1 OK
    ?DONE!
    ?SH-PROMPT

[shell update]
    !./nso-ha-control --scripting status --debug
    """???
Getting HA status and configuration from nodes n1, n2, n3 OK

+------+------------+--------------+-----------------+-----------------+
| node | ip         | current_role | default-ha-role | failover-master |
+------+------------+--------------+-----------------+-----------------+
| n1   | 172.18.1.2 | slave        | master          |                 |
| n2   | 172.18.2.2 | master       | slave           | yes             |
| n3   | 172.18.2.3 | none         | slave           |                 |
+------+------------+--------------+-----------------+-----------------+
default-ha-role and failover-master was retrieved from node "n1"
    """
    !./nso-ha-control --scripting package-status --debug
    """???
n1:
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| loaded          | installed                 | installable               |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+

n2:
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| loaded          | installed                 | installable               |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+

n3:
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| loaded          | installed                 | installable               |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
| tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 | ncs-4.6.1-tailf-hcc-4.4.3 |
+-----------------+---------------------------+---------------------------+
    """
[cleanup]
    !ID=`echo $$LUX_EXTRA_LOGS | grep -o "run_[0-9_]*"`
    ?SH-PROMPT
    !cp /tmp/nso-ha-control.log runs/nso-ha-control-$$ID.log
    ?SH-PROMPT
